%% Feedback transitions return beside the states instead of doubling back through them: https://github.com/Dicklesworthstone/frankenmermaid/issues/16
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Starting: Space down / tap
    Starting --> Idle: closed
    Starting --> Recording: opened
    Starting --> Releasing: Space up, focus lost
    Recording --> Idle: closed
    Recording --> Stopping: Space up, focus lost / tap
    Releasing --> Idle: closed
    Releasing --> Stopping: opened / tap
    Stopping --> Settling: closed
    Settling --> Idle: quiet 1 s
    Settling --> Stopping: opened / tap
